WEBVTT

00:00:27.329 --> 00:00:32.162
Our new capital, Brasília,
was designed by Oscar Niemeyer.

00:00:32.329 --> 00:00:34.246
It was the era of bossa nova,

00:00:34.287 --> 00:00:35.662
Cinema Novo,

00:00:35.704 --> 00:00:37.829
and everything felt possible.

00:00:38.329 --> 00:00:43.121
The construction of the “Skin of Glass”
began in the early ’60s.

00:00:43.412 --> 00:00:46.287
Tinted glass was imported from Belgium,

00:00:46.287 --> 00:00:48.579
marble from Greece,

00:00:48.621 --> 00:00:51.954
and it was the first curtain wall
designed in Brazil.

00:00:52.329 --> 00:00:54.246
Much like a curtain,

00:00:54.287 --> 00:00:58.621
the glass was separated
from the structural frame of the building,

00:00:58.662 --> 00:01:00.996
filtering the light and the weather.